words_where.plain, line 2: Add brackets around "the words of story", or keep the words under a name first.

    show the words of story where it starts with "b"
         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
Try one of these:
    show (the words of story) where it starts with "b"
  or
    set story words to the words of story
    show story words where it starts with "b"
Why: "where" goes with the value right before it, so here it would pick from "story" itself, which is text, not a list.

